questions.explanation:
$$
\vec{v} = v_0\hat{i} - \frac{E_0 e}{m} t\hat{k}
$$

$$
|\vec{v}| = \sqrt{v_0^2 + \left(\frac{E_0 e}{m} t\right)^2}
$$

$$
|\vec{v}| = \sqrt{v_0^2 + \frac{E_0^2 e^2 t^2}{m^2}}
$$

$$
\lambda_0 = \frac{h}{mv_0}
$$

$$
\lambda' = \frac{h}{m|\vec{v}|}
$$

$$
\lambda' = \frac{h}{m\sqrt{v_0^2 + \frac{E_0^2 e^2 t^2}{m^2}}}
$$

$$
\lambda' = \frac{h}{mv_0 \sqrt{1 + \frac{E_0^2 e^2 t^2}{m^2 v_0^2}}}
$$

$$
\lambda' = \frac{\lambda_0}{\sqrt{1 + \frac{E_0^2 e^2 t^2}{m^2 v_0^2}}}
$$
